{"availability":"available","full":"Symy-ai/Symy","name":"Symy","description":"Symy — AI green consumption guardian. Buy less. Live more. 少买一点，多活一点。","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-14T07:22:09Z","updated":"2026-10-09T22:00:54Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://symy-one.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://symy-one.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:34.240Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:34.240Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:34.240Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T22:06:34.240Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Symy is an open companion for sustainable consumption. Its elephant companion helps people pause, reflect, and turn engineered urges into choices that support a longer and freer life.","Commerce today runs on attention algorithms. They predict what you will want, when you are tired or lonely, and which words will move you to check out — then they meet you at exactly that moment. The other side of that asymmetry deserves the same technology.","Symy is not a shopping assistant. A shopping assistant optimizes for the cart; Symy optimizes for your life. It is a guardian companion, and the one thing it is built to do well is to say no — gently, with reasons, and always on your side."],"features":["Never blame the user. The manipulator is the growth machine, not the person. Symy frames every intercepted moment as a manipulation seen through, not a failure of willpower.","Pride and substance, both. Every feature must give you something to be proud of (shareable green honor) and something you actually keep (real money and resources saved).","Interception funnel — when an urge strikes, Symy walks the moment through a funnel: notice the emotional trigger, check the real need, then decide together whether it is worth buying, can wait, or better skipped.","Emotion guardian — late-night doomscrolling and stress-spending moments are exactly when manipulation works best. The companion watches for emotional patterns and offers support instead of a checkout button.","Green alternatives — before you buy new, Symy suggests reuse, second-hand, or fewer-and-better options, described qualitatively and honestly rather than with made-up carbon numbers."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Symy-ai/Symy/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f4052c5936a1aa9e8c6c0cdeed6000da684b9b8b0ea648f91b6ae5485df73a38","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:34.328Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:34.328Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Symy is an open companion for sustainable consumption. Its elephant companion helps people pause, reflect, and turn engineered urges into choices that support a longer and freer life.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Symy-ai/Symy/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Symy is an open companion for sustainable consumption. Its elephant companion helps people pause, reflect, and turn engineered urges into choices that support a longer and freer life.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Symy-ai/Symy/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"f4052c5936a1aa9e8c6c0cdeed6000da684b9b8b0ea648f91b6ae5485df73a38","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Symy-ai/Symy/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:34.329Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T22:00:54Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Symy-ai/Symy/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:34.329Z","hash":"f4052c5936a1aa9e8c6c0cdeed6000da684b9b8b0ea648f91b6ae5485df73a38","originalBytes":6270,"storedBytes":6270,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["symy","companion","doc","every","real","shopping","transparency","brain","data","hands","through","contributing.md","green","guardian","memory","never","product","run","when","api","app","cart","chat","checkout","family","feature","growth","inventory","li